<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIA-TELECOMS-Telstra plans electronic payments system.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIA-TELECOMS-Telstra plans electronic payments system.</headline>
<byline>Mark Bendeich</byline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Telstra Corp plans to launch an electronic payments platform in conjunction with banks to enable people to carry out financial transactions on Telstra's new broadband network.</p>
<p>Telstra Multimedia chief executive Gerry Moriarty, who is charged with pioneering the state-owned telecom's expensive move into online services, told Reuters the payments platform would be launched before the end of calendar 1996.</p>
</text>
